      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Markdown Snippets are closely related to __TRILIUM_PH_0__Templates__TRILIUM_PH_1__, but instead of defining the content of an entire note, a snippet is a reusable piece of Markdown text that can easily be inserted into a __TRILIUM_PH_2__Markdown__TRILIUM_PH_3__ note.",
